Z||000000||Matt86Z||06-16-2001||05:38 PM||||What are you Fiero guys doping for suspension buildup? Currently, I have these...<P>: Jamex 1.5" drop springs<BR>: Performance shocks/struts<BR>: SSM full subframe connectors<BR>: Edelbrock STB<BR>: 16X8" aluminum diamond spoke wheels <BR>: Sticky rain tires<P>New bushings, and whatnot are next on the list, as well as boxing my LCAs...anyone else?||||reg||6
Z||000001||Uaana||06-16-2001||11:59 PM||||Let's see. <BR>Still keeping it on the tame side. <BR>Suspension Techniques springs 1.5 drop<BR>KYB shocks and struts. <BR>Rear anti-sway bar<BR>15" Sunfire rims running Sumitomo performance tourning.<BR>Bushings to be replaced by poly as needed.<P>Oh and my new 3.4 for more corner exit power. Ya thats it.||||reg||1
